            <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'long', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' })}</p>
            
            <p>Please read these Terms and Conditions carefully before using the Typing Exam Practice website.</p>
            
            <h3 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 24px; color: var(--color-ink);">1. Acceptance of Terms</h3>
            <p>By accessing and using this website, you accept and agree to be bound by the terms and provision of this agreement. If you do not agree to abide by these terms, please do not use this service.</p>
            
            <h3 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 24px; color: var(--color-ink);">2. Use of Service</h3>
            <p>Typing Exam Practice is provided for personal, educational, and professional development purposes. You agree to use the site and its features responsibly. Do not attempt to reverse engineer, disrupt, or attack the underlying infrastructure.</p>
            
