            <p>This service is currently in Beta. It is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. We make no warranties, expressed or implied, and hereby disclaim and negate all other warranties including, without limitation, implied warranties or conditions of merchantability.</p>
            
            <h3 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 24px; color: var(--color-ink);">5. Limitations</h3>
            <p>In no event shall Typing Exam Practice be liable for any damages (including, without limitation, damages for loss of data or profit, or due to business interruption) arising out of the use or inability to use the materials on our website.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</MainLayout>
